<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2026-11 on</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2026-11/</link><description>Recent content in 2026-11 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yshghid.github.io/tags/2026-11/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>잔잔한시간</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily35/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily35/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="잔잔한시간"&gt;&#10; 잔잔한시간&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%9e%94%ec%9e%94%ed%95%9c%ec%8b%9c%ea%b0%84"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-09&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae1db193-9ee6-43be-9443-1e2a80ddf8f7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;주말에는 강릉을 다녀왔는데 마음속에 남아있던 잡념들이 조용해져서 좋은 시간이었다. 엄마아빠도 즐거워보여서 더더 행복했다. 또 놀고 싶었다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82c0c5db-3843-4bd5-b1a8-39dda82baceb" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c854375-0927-44a0-af92-9d88fa82fc04" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;오늘은 연구 가닥을 잡고 일도 하고&amp;hellip; 일과중엔 생각을 많이 하지 않고 무난 평온한 시간을 보냈다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;집오는길에는 새로 생긴 비밀베이커리를 언제 가볼까 했었는데 오늘 땡겨서 비밀샌드위치를 사와서 먹었다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;그리고 새로산 헤어클로가 와서 이래저래 해봤는데 원래 샀던것보다 크고 예뻐서 잘산것같다고 생각했다 ㅎㅎ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;하나하나 나는 매일 나아지고 있는것이 좋다. 잘나아가보자 그리구 기록도 잊지말자.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>강릉</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/travel/travel1/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/travel/travel1/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="강릉"&gt;&#10; 강릉&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ea%b0%95%eb%a6%89"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-08&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54278093-cee4-4c7f-a0d1-0cf258ec5e0b" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a60bfd7-c6f9-485d-90ae-6982868b2f5f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6587b195-c43f-49a0-85eb-d99fdfa9949a" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/118f0061-10bf-4922-a30f-89886e55ac69" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8be39f7b-3c49-4b5b-8bd1-69cb394af9db" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97929a44-337c-4b4b-a7b3-1c39180d3291" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/989af00f-fae9-4753-aedf-a458817741e8" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f27e5b18-95dc-4074-acc5-d1275d659337" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47900f12-b7bc-40eb-be8e-1de5fcf785d0" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/772dd00d-ff1b-4d0a-a3ff-4faf6c7c29c4" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a6b10f8-5ae6-4ba8-bfdf-c3e97e083116" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c5093d5-d69c-4286-a0d0-8e742df26e56" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0a25c9b-cacf-41e3-bcbd-f521531cfe9d" /&gt;&#10;&lt