+0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/wine/wine5/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="롱반-진판델-캘리포니아"&gt;&#10; 롱반 진판델 캘리포니아&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%a1%b1%eb%b0%98-%ec%a7%84%ed%8c%90%eb%8d%b8-%ec%ba%98%eb%a6%ac%ed%8f%ac%eb%8b%88%ec%95%84"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-08&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78a82bc0-0f95-449e-b201-27d00ba65c6e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;병이 예뻐서 사본 레드와인,,&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;맛은 잘 안알아보고 샀는데 가벼운 맛이었다. 풍미는 잘 모르겠고 알콜 맛이 많이 나서 한잔만 마시고 방치중이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;레드와인 저렴한걸로 살거면 무거운 맛이라도 있어야 마실만하다&amp;hellip;는 교훈을 얻은 와인이었다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18b22ac8-d8c3-45d7-ba18-bc7ed6ee93b5" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;와인은 별로였지만 애슐리에서 첨으로 칠리새우를 사왔는데 요게 넘넘 맛있었다 ㅎㅎㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>겨울날</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily34/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily34/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="겨울날"&gt;&#10; 겨울날&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ea%b2%a8%ec%9a%b8%eb%82%a0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-05&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5aa0923c-ed50-4730-83ea-d54c356dcd22" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae6da25a-0145-4e11-80d0-3479000d6de9" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c44057d1-f123-49bb-ba2a-c981ca9b6fba" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1aa5272-b795-4e93-bcf3-a7431ca20c0b" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aaf5c92b-116f-49ce-8a3f-1a1240edbb07" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f41c1a4-1741-4bcf-98e5-cf877652fe88" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee13b23e-84bd-470c-b915-3a6cc60c9939" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1179" height="2096" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10c0281b-c084-4595-b68c-4129103dd904" /&gt;</description></item><item><title>겨울은 배신감의계절</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/music/music2/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/music/music2/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="겨울은-배신감의계절"&gt;&#10; 겨울은 배신감의계절&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ea%b2%a8%ec%9a%b8%ec%9d%80-%eb%b0%b0%ec%8b%a0%ea%b0%90%ec%9d%98%ea%b3%84%ec%a0%88"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1168" height="1502" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91d4dc82-9e8b-498a-920d-e10f8345be23" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="971" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25ae2f7c-158b-4d1f-be45-0522a41681e2" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1172" height="1026" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a1092a0-bb42-42e9-a475-94a80f33e749" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="741" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9762a500-006d-4359-a79d-c2eb757219b6" /&gt;</description></item><item><title>시</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/book/book57/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/book/book57/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="시"&gt;&#10; 시&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%8b%9c"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;위기가 닥쳤을 때 사람들은 진기한 것을 구경하러 가거나 &amp;ldquo;전부 나가서 영화를 봐야 해&amp;quot;라거나 &amp;ldquo;발레를 보면 나을거야&amp;quot;라고 말하지 않는다. 우리가 찾는 것은 항상 시다. 우리가 듣고 싶은 것은 우리 귀에 속삭이는 인간의 목소리인 것이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;귀에 대고 속삭이는 시인의 음성이 위로가 될 수 있는 까닭은 삶의 가장 고통스럽고 섬뜩한 순간에도 위엄을 유지할 수 있다고 말해주기 때문이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;시는 가장 추한 감정들을 인정하는 동시에, 그 사이에 질서를 부여해 고귀하게 만든다. 시는 표현력이 무척 풍부하면서도 구성과 형식이 엄격하고 극도로 정제된 언어를 사용한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>지나고나면다색채일뿐</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily33/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily33/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="지나고나면다색채일뿐"&gt;&#10; 지나고나면다색채일뿐&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%a7%80%eb%82%98%ea%b3%a0%eb%82%98%eb%a9%b4%eb%8b%a4%ec%83%89%ec%b1%84%ec%9d%bc%eb%bf%90"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/919849fd-a4cc-45c2-8f11-eeae621a4ef8" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8b7bb52-dcd5-4f00-8350-243ec73dc60f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="2099" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3cc94ac2-2f48-442c-94e6-848eb7b7ac60" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="2065" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4adadc19-5291-415b-b278-444bf43ada2d" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="794" height="1164" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc599b97-f290-40e5-8707-7b8a882efdb9" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3504a55-e3d9-4f12-b81c-e0f76ed2b1e7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9c48ce6-64c1-46b8-8317-0b420101ff9e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf81187b-d5a4-45f8-a5c0-376e6694a6df" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90291aa0-5170-4ccd-b9df-83eaab955e0f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c82ddbf-e0f9-4e97-a3e0-db7f0e67c010" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1157d9b9-8339-4c99-99ec-b66a73a105a5" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1adae60e-9c4e-444c-b5ce-8db90557874c" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1262" height="1684" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f436da79-bc24-4dbc-ac50-8e9dfd648e42" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="2244" height="1664" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f574b6ec-f682-41e1-912d-a315bc8a69ae" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1076" height="806" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49f3ec50-f09f-498a-8246-f3205c777ffc" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="1352" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97882deb-40da-49d1-a0a6-d0f74d760041" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;인간은 아픔을 싫어하는데 왜 아픔을 승화시킨것들은 아름다울까? 왜마음을 울릴까?&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>트러플헌터 모스카토 다스티</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/wine/wine4/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/wine/wine4/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="트러플헌터-모스카토-다스티"&gt;&#10; 트러플헌터 모스카토 다스티&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%8a%b8%eb%9f%ac%ed%94%8c%ed%97%8c%ed%84%b0-%eb%aa%a8%ec%8a%a4%ec%b9%b4%ed%86%a0-%eb%8b%a4%ec%8a%a4%ed%8b%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1258" height="1682" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf2b2d2f-b60e-41ab-b5b2-ae2445b5d34e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;연어롤이랑 같이 먹으려고 구매한 스파클링와인 !!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;달달한 와인은 다 거기서 거기 아닌가? 싶어서 안사먹었었는데 이날은 달달한게 끌려서 구매하였다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;그리고 맛은 생각보다 너무너무 맛있었다 ㅎㅎ 가볍고 음료수같은 단맛이 아니라 포도의 무겁고 들척지근한 단맛이 났는데 그 정도가 역하지 않고 너무 좋았다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;탄산은 강하지는 않아서 화이트~스파클링 그 중간같다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1162" height="784" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bba6f47d-bc23-4598-bbc0-4ec2a413752a" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1170" height="1342" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a83c1ab-7df7-41bb-a301-cb876e0c0778" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;테이스팅 노트대로 산미는 그렇게 안났다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;다른 리뷰를 보니까 꿀의 단맛이라고도 하고 시트러스향이 난다고 했는데 뭔가 묵직한 단맛이라는점은 맞는것같고 담에 마실때 향도 다시 확인해봐야겠다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>